### Import Multiple Icons in React (JSX)

Source: https://context7.com/hugeicons/hugeicons-react/llms.txt

Demonstrates two ways to import multiple icons from 'hugeicons-react': named imports for tree-shaking and namespace imports for dynamic icon selection. Named imports are suitable for static usage, while namespace imports allow for selecting icons based on a string name.

```jsx
import {
  Home01Icon,
  MarketingIcon,
  UserIcon,
  SettingsIcon,
  NotificationIcon
} from "hugeicons-react";

function Navigation() {
  return (
    <nav>
      <Home01Icon size={24} />
      <UserIcon size={24} />
      <SettingsIcon size={24} />
    </nav>
  );
}

// Namespace import (all icons)
import * as HugeIcons from "hugeicons-react";

function DynamicIcon({ iconName }) {
  const Icon = HugeIcons[iconName];

  if (!Icon) {
    return <div>Icon not found</div>;
  }

  return <Icon size={32} />;
}

// Usage
<DynamicIcon iconName="Home01Icon" />
<DynamicIcon iconName="MarketingIcon" />
```

